      "core_meaning_cn": "把某事“提出并要求被承认”：可以声称为真、主张权利、申请应得款项；灾难 claim lives 则表示夺去生命",
      "core_meaning_en": "put forward something as true, due, or belonging to someone",
      "mental_model_cn": "claim that → 声称；claim a right/land → 主张权利；insurance claim / claim compensation → 索赔；disaster claims lives → 夺去生命。noun claim 也可指一个有争议的断言。",
      "mental_model_en": "A claim seeks recognition of truth, right, payment, or possession; the idiom claim lives means cause deaths."
